OL,5,Aunfair                                 
OL,7,FUniversity groups warn any reduction in
OL,8,FEU student fees could put pressure on  
OL,9,FUK student places and take more money  
OL,10,Fout of UK higher education             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
