OL,3,ACalls for consent defence change after 
OL,4,AJoanne Young rape case                 
OL,6,FThe daughter of Joanne Young, who was  
OL,7,Fdrugged, raped and advertised for sex  
OL,8,Fonline by her husband, is among those  
OL,9,Fcalling for a change in the way cases  
OL,10,Fare defended in court.                 
OL,12,FPhilip Young drugged and abused his    
OL,13,Fwife over a 13-year period, using      
OL,14,Fwebsites and apps to invite men to     
OL,15,Ftheir home in Swindon without her      
OL,16,Fknowledge. On Thursday, four men were  
OL,17,Ffound guilty of sexual offences against
OL,18,Fher.                                   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
