OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall after blockbuster
OL,4,Aopening as wider tech sell-off         
OL,5,Acontinues                              
OL,7,FAnthropic's shares have dropped back   
OL,8,Ftowards their initial price after a    
OL,9,Fsoaring first day on the stock market, 
OL,10,Fas a wider tech sell-off deepens.      
OL,12,FThe fall in tech stocks continued to   
OL,13,Fweigh on markets, with the S&P 500 down
OL,14,Fmore than 2% and the Dow Jones         
OL,15,FIndustrial Average down 0.7% by        
OL,16,Flunchtime.                             
OL,18,FBoth US indexes touched correction     
OL,19,Fterritory, a point where they are      
OL,20,Ftrading at 10% or more down from a     
OL,21,Frecent high.                           
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
